{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 1480,
    "dDurationMs": 3640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm gonna give you guys three numbers. A\nthree number sequence and I have a rule"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5130,
    "dDurationMs": 4370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in mind that these three numbers obey\nand I want you to try to figure out what that rule is."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 9500,
    "dDurationMs": 5160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But the way you can get information is by proposing your own set of three numbers, to which I will say yes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 14760,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that follows my rule or no it doesn't follow my rule. And then you can propose what you think the rule is."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 19000,
    "dDurationMs": 859,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Is that fair?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 19859,
    "dDurationMs": 4481,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Okay, so here are the three\nnumbers: 2, 4, 8."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 24780,
    "dDurationMs": 860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "2, 4, 8."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 26070,
    "dDurationMs": 3029,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You don't need to continue the sequence,\nyou can propose a totally different"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 29099,
    "dDurationMs": 3880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "sequence, whatever you want to propose\nand I will simply say yes or no"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 32980,
    "dDurationMs": 1480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "2, 4, 8?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 35720,
    "dDurationMs": 1260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "16, 32"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 37460,
    "dDurationMs": 740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "16"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 39000,
    "dDurationMs": 1160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "32"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 40780,
    "dDurationMs": 860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 42160,
    "dDurationMs": 920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "64?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 44180,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Those also follow my rule."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 45380,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "ok"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 46180,
    "dDurationMs": 1540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What's the rule you think?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 47720,
    "dDurationMs": 980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Multiply by 2?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 48860,
    "dDurationMs": 1160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 50020,
    "dDurationMs": 900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "not my rule."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 50920,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 51600,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's not my rule."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 52100,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But you're allowed, if you want, propose 3 other numbers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 55720,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "3, 6, 12."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 58080,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "3, 6, 12? Follows my rule."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 60560,
    "dDurationMs": 1540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "10, 20, 40."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 62100,
    "dDurationMs": 1120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That follows the rule."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 63640,
    "dDurationMs": 1040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm still multiplying by two"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 64680,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I know"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 65180,
    "dDurationMs": 1060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[Laughter]"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 66280,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I know what you're doing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 67640,
    "dDurationMs": 2680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and yes it follows my rule but no it's not\nmy rule."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 70540,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "5, 10 and 20?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 73200,
    "dDurationMs": 680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Follows my rule"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 73890,
    "dDurationMs": 3080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "100, 200, 400?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 77240,
    "dDurationMs": 1080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Follows my rule"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 78320,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "500, 1000, 2000"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 80540,
    "dDurationMs": 900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Follows my rule."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 81840,
    "dDurationMs": 1100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You want me to keep going?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 82940,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But do I just keep going? You going to tell me or what?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 85240,
    "dDurationMs": 1340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[Laughter]"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 86890,
    "dDurationMs": 2300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Am I doing it the wrong way? Am I approaching this the wrong way?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 89190,
    "dDurationMs": 3520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You're totally fine, but you're approaching the way most\npeople approach it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 92710,
    "dDurationMs": 1730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like think strategically about this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 94450,
    "dDurationMs": 3419,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You want information. I have\ninformation. The point of the three"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 97869,
    "dDurationMs": 3631,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "numbers, right, is to allow you to figure\nout what the rule is."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 101500,
    "dDurationMs": 3750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Okay, I'm going to give you the\nnumbers that I don't think fits the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 105250,
    "dDurationMs": 1480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "sequence and see what you'll say."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 107880,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I'll say 2, 4, 7."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 111980,
    "dDurationMs": 840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Fits my rule"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 112990,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, whatever I propose is right? So, is\nyour rule like"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 116710,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you can propose any number?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 118600,
    "dDurationMs": 1720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, the rule is anything we say is yes?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 120320,
    "dDurationMs": 680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 121180,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Damn it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 121680,
    "dDurationMs": 1220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[Laughter]"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 122900,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But you were on the right track now."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 124880,
    "dDurationMs": 1300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hit me with three numbers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 126180,
    "dDurationMs": 1180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "3, 6, 9."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 127360,
    "dDurationMs": 1540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Follows my rule."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 131240,
    "dDurationMs": 1300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hmm..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 133160,
    "dDurationMs": 1460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, that didn't follow my rule."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 136120,
    "dDurationMs": 1240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is good, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 137360,
    "dDurationMs": 1180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "5, 10, 15."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 138540,
    "dDurationMs": 1480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That follows my rule."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 140300,
    "dDurationMs": 1940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What? Oh... Really?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 142240,
    "dDurationMs": 820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 143060,
    "dDurationMs": 900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I don't believe this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 144740,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "1, 2, 3?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 146740,
    "dDurationMs": 780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Follows the rule"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 147520,
    "dDurationMs": 1480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What about 7, 8, 9?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 149040,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[Laughter] Yes, that follows the rule."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 152100,
    "dDurationMs": 980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "8"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 153440,
    "dDurationMs": 960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "16"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 154780,
    "dDurationMs": 700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "39"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 155920,
    "dDurationMs": 1020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Fits the rule."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 156940,
    "dDurationMs": 780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Excellent."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 158040,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But we're no closer to the rule. I want you\nget to the rule."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 161540,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How about 1, 7, 13 ?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 165020,
    "dDurationMs": 1160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Follows the rule."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 167140,
    "dDurationMs": 1100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "11, 12, 13?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 168240,
    "dDurationMs": 1300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How does this make sense? Follows the rule."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 169540,
    "dDurationMs": 1720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "10, 9, 8? I don't know how to do this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 171520,
    "dDurationMs": 840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Does not follow the rule."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 172360,
    "dDurationMs": 1100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "10, 9, 8 does not."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 173840,
    "dDurationMs": 2980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, so, is it all in ascending order?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 177060,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Boo yeah! Up top!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 179280,
    "dDurationMs": 2180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes. First ones to get it. You guys nailed it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 181460,
    "dDurationMs": 1020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's the rule"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 182489,
    "dDurationMs": 2680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's the rule. Numbers in increasing order."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 185169,
    "dDurationMs": 840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Awww"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 186009,
    "dDurationMs": 831,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Numbers in ascending order"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 188040,
    "dDurationMs": 2660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 10, 15, 25, doesn't matter."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 190700,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Any numbers in ascending order."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 194560,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I was inspired to make this video by the\nbook the black swan by Nassim Taleb."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 198660,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, the black swan is a metaphor for the\nunknown and the unexpected."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 202500,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean in the old world the theory was\nthat all swans were white."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 205640,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, each instance of a white swan would\nmake you think,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 208760,
    "dDurationMs": 1140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"Yeah, that theory is pretty good.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 209900,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But the point is you can never\nprove a theory true and in fact when"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 213330,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "people found Australia they realized\nthat there were black swans."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 216510,
    "dDurationMs": 3210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What was interesting for me was that\neveryone I spoke to came up with a rule"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 219720,
    "dDurationMs": 4160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "very early on and then only proposed\nnumbers that fit with that rule they were thinking."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 223880,
    "dDurationMs": 2740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I was looking for you guys\nto propose a set of numbers that didn't"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 226620,
    "dDurationMs": 3750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "follow your rule and didn't follow\nmy rule. I was looking for you guys not"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 230370,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to try to confirm what you believe. \nYou're always asking something where you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 233910,
    "dDurationMs": 1530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "expect the answer  to be yes, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 235440,
    "dDurationMs": 5100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like, you're trying to get at it.\nBut, instead you want to get the no's."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 240540,
    "dDurationMs": 3380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You want to get the no because that's much more\ninformational for you then yes,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 243920,
    "dDurationMs": 800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like everything is a yes.."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 244720,
    "dDurationMs": 1840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is true. That is really true and\nonce you say that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 246860,
    "dDurationMs": 5360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is what's so important about the scientific method. We set out to disprove our theories"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 252220,
    "dDurationMs": 6020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it's when can't disprove them that we say this\nmust be getting at something really true"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 258250,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "about our reality. So, I think we should\ndo that in all aspects of our lives"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 261970,
    "dDurationMs": 1840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if you think that something is true you\nshould"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 263810,
    "dDurationMs": 2330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "try as hard as you can to disprove it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 266240,
    "dDurationMs": 4260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Only then can you really get at the\ntruth and not fool yourself."
    } ]
  } ]
}
